      {
        "n": "Archived W/ Rotational",
        "s": "2026-10-26T16:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-10-26T17:00:00Z",
        "d": "Monthly reports from Rotational, the archivist & DJ focussing on electronic dance music from Africa and South-America. Dance to the sound of digitized kuduro CDs, baile funk found on a USB-stick from Rio, or Moroccan techno from dusty cassette tapes. Besides DJing, Rotational also runs a YouTube channel filled with musical finds from all around the world.\nFrom the host: \"An hour of pop raï pulled from my own shelf of CDs and cassettes. Drum machines, synths, wah-wah guitars and plenty more. Featuring Chaba Fadela, Cheb Kada, Khaled and many others.\"",
        "j": "Rotational",
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/rotational/episodes/rotational-26th-october-2026",
        "t": "monthly"
      },
      {
        "n": "HIT A LICK RADIO w/ Blackwealth",
